            <div class="tldr-grid">
                <div>
                    <h3>Broadcast & Audio</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Director of Operations & Technology, WXPR Public Radio</li>
                        <li>SBE Certified Radio Operator</li>
                        <li>4 years recording engineer, St. Olaf College</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3>IT & Networking</h3>
